# Owner decision 2026-11-15: pinyin typed and not confirmed is dropped when the user leaves the composition (a click
# outside or inside the same field, Tab moving the focus, another app, the window closing): nothing of it stays in the
# field, no marked text is left, the panel is hidden.
NAME clicking elsewhere inside a field drops its unconfirmed pinyin
PROFILES all
LANG chinese
TEXT "Hi |"
TYPE nihao
EXPECT marked "nihao"
CLICK inside 0
EXPECT doc "|Hi "
EXPECT marked none
EXPECT panel hidden
